ANACREON 10
"First Light: 4021"
0     ; random scenario
1 3   ; 1-3 players
21    ; 21x21 galaxy
50    ; 50 planets
0     ; Difficulty: Beginner
50 0  ; 50+ years
4021
BEGINTEXT

        "...The First Empire did not fall. It shattered. A thousand worlds
   broke apart like glass, and the shards scattered into darkness. For a
   millennium, humanity forgot it had ever touched the stars. Worlds that
   once traded with a hundred systems forgot their own neighbors. Some
   regressed to medieval technology; others never advanced beyond the
   stone age. The galaxy became a collection of isolated islands, each
   believing itself alone..."
                                 From: The Seeds of Panemonde,
                                       by Lord Jonathan R. Rowehin.

 Four thousand years have passed since the collapse. The galaxy is slowly
 waking from its long sleep. Federations have formed where once there was
 only silence. Empires are rising from the ashes of old kingdoms. And
 though hundreds of worlds still live in ignorance of their neighbors,
 there is a growing hope that a Second Empire might rise from the first.
NEWPAGE
 You rule a single world. For years you have built your fleet in secret,
 preparing to forge an empire from the surrounding systems. You possess
 a handful of ancient ships -- relics from a time before the fall -- that
 will give you an edge over the primitive powers around you. Your goal is
 the unification of the galaxy, preferably under your flag.

 The stars are waiting.
ENDTEXT

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Zone 2 is in the center of the galaxy and will contain mostly primitive
; planets.  Zones 3 through 6 form the periphery and will contain most of the
; powerful and advanced planets.
; Zones 7 through 11 will contain each of the 5 player empires and are spread
; throughout the galaxy.

; Define zone 2 in the center of the galaxy ------------------------------------
DefineZone 2 6,6 16,16

; Define zones 3-6 in the periphery --------------------------------------------
DefineZone 3  6,1  21,5
DefineZone 4 17,6  21,21
DefineZone 5  1,17 16,21
DefineZone 6  1,1   5,16
DefineZone 7  5,14  9,18            ; location of empire 1
DefineZone 8  13,4  17,8            ; location of empire 2
DefineZone 9  10,10 12,12           ; location of empire 3
DefineZone 10 16,16 20,20           ; location of empire 4
DefineZone 11  2,2   6,6            ; location of empire 5

; Create 5 player empires ------------------------------------------------------
; Each of the five empires has one of the previously created capitals.
; NOTE: If there are less than five players, then not all five empires will
; be created.  The capitals will remain as independent worlds, however.

CreatePlayerEmpire 0 0 7 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 1 0 7 0
CreatePlayerEmpire 2 0 7 0

CreateNPEmpire 1
3           ; Aggressor Empire
RndName     ; Name of the empire
0           ; (undefined)
7           ; Bio tech
0           ; (undefined)

CreateNPEmpire 2
3           ; Aggressor Empire
RndName     ; Name of the empire
0           ; (undefined)
7           ; Bio tech
0           ; (undefined)

CreateNPEmpire 3
3           ; Aggressor Empire
RndName     ; Name of the empire
0           ; (undefined)
7           ; Bio tech
0           ; (undefined)

CreateNPEmpire 4
3           ; Aggressor Empire
RndName     ; Name of the empire
0           ; (undefined)
7           ; Bio tech
0           ; (undefined)


